  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 41574,
    "section": "mod-tome/dialogs/Donation.lua",
    "source": "Hi, I am Nicolas (DarkGod), the maker of this game.\nIt is my dearest hope that you find my game enjoyable, and that you will continue to do so for many years to come!\n\nToME is free and open-source and will stay that way, but that does not mean I can live without money, so I have come to disturb you here and now to ask for your kindness.\nIf you feel that the (many) hours you have spent having fun were worth it, please consider making a donation for the future of the game.\n\nDonators are also granted a few special features: %s.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "你好，我是Nicolas (DarkGod)，这个游戏的制作者。\n我最衷心的希望你会觉得我的游戏很有趣，并且在今后的许多年里你还会继续游玩这款游戏！\n\nToME是免费开源的游戏，并且会一直保持这样。但是我仍然需要钱来生活，所以我来这里打扰你，希望得到你的帮助\n如果你觉得在游戏中体验的时间充满了快乐，你可以考虑捐赠一下，让这个游戏的未来变得更好。\n\n捐赠者将会得到一些游戏的附加功能：%s。",
    "args_order": null,
    "special": null,
    "logical_path": "mod-tome.lua",
    "component": "tome",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "net_changed": true,
    "audit_id": "entry-03191",
    "snapshot_sha256": "56be7c470151dcaa9b500c6d798df0e641f08c990eb3541e9082af6779ddb689"
  },
