  },
  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 41819,
    "section": "mod-tome/dialogs/GameOptions.lua",
    "source": "Keep a copy of your character sheets (not the whole savefile) on the online vault at te4.org.\nFor each character you will be given a link to this online character sheet so that you can brag about your heroic deeds or sad deaths to your friends or the whole community.#WHITE#",
    "source_tag": "_t",
    "target": "在te4.org上保存一份你的角色信息（不是整个存档）。\n每个角色你都会得到一个链接，用来向你的朋友或整个社区炫耀你的英雄事迹或悲壮之死。#WHITE#",
    "args_order": null,
    "special": null,
    "logical_path": "mod-tome.lua",
    "component": "tome",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "net_changed": true,
    "audit_id": "entry-03202",
    "snapshot_sha256": "a9a2cb93d67db13b1e5085d7e5e3512f3e079f641c60bf65214245027a666b54"
  },
  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 41835,
    "section": "mod-tome/dialogs/GameOptions.lua",
    "source": "Disables all connectivity to the network.\nThis includes, but is not limited to:\n- Player profiles: You will not be able to login, register\n- Characters vault: You will not be able to upload any character to the online vault to show your glory\n- Item's Vault: You will not be able to access the online item's vault, this includes both storing and retrieving items.\n- Ingame chat: The ingame chat requires to connect to the server to talk to other players, this will not be possible.\n- Purchaser / Donator benefits: The base game being free, the only way to give donators their bonuses fairly is to check their online profile. This will thus be disabled.\n- Easy addons downloading & installation: You will not be able to see ingame the list of available addons, nor to one-click install them. You may still do so manually.\n- Version checks: Addons will not be checked for new versions.\n- Discord: If you use Discord Rich Presence integration this will also be disabled by this setting.\n- Ingame game news: The main menu will stop showing you info about new updates to the game.\n\nNote that this setting only affects the game itself. If you use the game launcher, whose sole purpose is to make sure the game is up to date, it will still do so.\nIf you do not want that, simply run the game directly: the #{bold}#only#{normal}# use of the launcher is to update the game.\n\n#{bold}##CRIMSON#This is an extremely restrictive setting. It is recommended you only activate it if you have no other choice as it will remove many fun and acclaimed features.\nA full exit and restart of the game is neccessary to apply this setting.#{normal}#",
    "source_tag": "_t",
    "target": "禁止所有网络请求\n包括但不仅限于：\n- 用户信息：不能登录或者注册。\n- 角色备份：不能在te4.org上保存你的角色信息（用来给其他人分享你的炫酷角色）。\n- 物品仓库：不能访问你的在线物品仓库（包括存入和取回）。\n- 游戏内聊天：游戏内聊天需要连接服务器才能与其他玩家交谈，这将无法使用。\n- 购买者/捐赠者福利：基础游戏免费，公平发放捐赠者奖励的唯一途径是检查他们的在线档案，因此该功能将被禁用。\n- 插件便捷下载与安装：你将无法在游戏内看到可用插件列表，也无法一键安装，但仍可手动安装。\n- 插件版本更新：无法更新插件的版本。\n- Discord：无法同步到Discord的实时状态。\n- 游戏内新闻：主菜单将不再显示新闻。\n注意这个设置只影响游戏本身。如果你使用游戏启动器，它的唯一目的就是确保游戏是最新的，因此它仍然会连接网络。\n如果你不想这样，直接运行游戏即可。启动器#{bold}#只#{normal}#是用来更新游戏的。\n\n\n#{bold}##CRIMSON#这是一个极端的选项。如果不是迫不得已，推荐你不要打开它，这会让你失去很多好用的功能和一些游戏体验。\n应用这个选项必须退出重新进入游戏。#{normal}#",
    "args_order": null,
    "special": null,
    "logical_path": "mod-tome.lua",
    "component": "tome",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "net_changed": true,
    "audit_id": "entry-03203",
    "snapshot_sha256": "0b6c6adfeaa450d5af8ef2728bbd177adf032419ab01f42a4a0119c81a358071"
  },
